* =====================================================================
* LTSPICE NETLIST - PHYSICALLY & ELECTRICALLY VERIFIED
* Speichern unter: "simulation.net" (oder .cir) - NICHT als .asc speichern!
* Öffnen über: File -> Open (Dateityp "Netlists")
* =====================================================================
.options cshunt=1e-15

* --- Spannungsversorgungen ---
V_VS VS 0 24
V_5V +5V 0 5

* --- Steuersignale (10 kHz komplementäres PWM) ---
V_IN1 IN1 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1u 1u 45u 100u)
V_IN2 IN2 0 PULSE(5 0 0 1u 1u 45u 100u)

* --- L6203 Treiber Instanziierung ---
* Pinreihenfolge: OUT2 VS OUT1 BOOT1 IN1 GND IN2 BOOT2 SENSE EN VREF
XIC1 OUT2 VS OUT1 Net-_IC1-CBOOT1_ IN1 0 IN2 Net-_IC1-CBOOT2_ Net-_IC1-SENSE_ +5V Net-_IC1-VREF_ L6203

* --- L6203 SPICE-Makromodell (Subcircuit) ---
.SUBCKT L6203 OUT2 VS OUT1 BOOT1 IN1 GND IN2 BOOT2 SENSE EN VREF
M1 VS 41 3 3 DMOS_N
M2 3 51 GND GND DMOS_N
M3 VS 81 1 1 DMOS_N
M4 1 71 GND GND DMOS_N
E1 41 3 VALUE = { IF( V(IN1)>1.5 AND V(EN)>1.5, V(BOOT1)-V(3), 0 ) }
E2 51 GND VALUE = { IF( V(IN1)<0.8 AND V(EN)>1.5, 5, 0 ) }
E3 81 1 VALUE = { IF( V(IN2)>1.5 AND V(EN)>1.5, V(BOOT2)-V(1), 0 ) }
E4 71 GND VALUE = { IF( V(IN2)<0.8 AND V(EN)>1.5, 5, 0 ) }
R_SENSE GND SENSE 100k
V_REF VREF GND 5.0
.MODEL DMOS_N NMOS (VTO=2.5 KP=20 VMAX=1E6 RS=0.15 RD=0.15)
.ENDS L6203

* --- Aktive Netzwerkskomponenten (L6203 Peripherie) ---
C2 VS 0 470u
C3 VS 0 470u
C8 VS 0 10u

C10 +5V 0 100n
C12 +5V 0 100n
C9 +5V 0 100n
C11 +5V 0 100n

* Bootstrap-Kondensatoren (Zwingend für High-Side Gate-Driver)
C5 Net-_IC1-CBOOT1_ OUT1 22n
C6 OUT2 Net-_IC1-CBOOT2_ 22n

* Snubber-Netzwerk an den Ausgängen
C7 OUT1 Net-_C7-Pad2_ 22n
R6 Net-_C7-Pad2_ OUT2 10

* SENSE Filterung (0.33 Ohm Shunt & RC-Filter)
R1 Net-_IC1-SENSE_ 0 0.33
R2 /SENSE Net-_IC1-SENSE_ 1k
C1 /SENSE 0 10n

* VREF Pufferkondensator
C4 Net-_IC1-VREF_ 0 10n

* Optionaler Lastwiderstand für den Brückenausgang (Motor-Ersatz)
R_LOAD OUT1 OUT2 10

* --- Deaktivierte/Unbenutzte Peripheriekomponenten (zur Fehlervermeidung auskommentiert) ---
* R5 +5V Net-_U1-1OUT_ 4.7k
* R11 Net-_R11-Pad1_ 0 10k
* D5 +5V Net-_D5-A_ LED
* R13 +5V Net-_D5-A_ 1k
* R9 +5V /Booster_Signal_B 4.7k
* R10 +5V /Booster_Signal_A 4.7k
* R12 +5V Net-_D4-A_ 1k
* D4 0 Net-_D4-A_ LED
* R8 /DCC_Signal_B Net-_D2-K_ 1.2k
* D2 0 Net-_D2-K_ __D2
* R3 +5V Net-_U1-1IN-_ 24k
* R4 Net-_U1-1IN-_ 0 1k
* R7 /DCC_Signal_A Net-_D1-K_ 1.2k
* D1 0 Net-_D1-K_ __D1
* U1 __U1
* U4 __U4
* J4 __J4
* SW1 __SW1
* J2 __J2
* J3 __J3
* SW2 __SW2
* U3 __U3
* J1 __J1
* D3 __D3
* PS1 __PS1
* U2 __U2

* --- SPICE Modelle ---
.model __D2 D
.model __D1 D
.model LED D

* --- Simulationsbefehl ---
.tran 20m

.end